@startuml
title b LINE if EXPR / break LINE if EXPR — Add a conditional breakpoint
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
participant "Scanner / branches" as B
U -> UI : b LINE if EXPR / break LINE if EXPR
UI -> S : add_line_breakpoint(LINE, condition)
S -> B : source_target(LINE): resolve supported statement
S -> S : Store requested line, enclosing expression, target and condition
S --> UI : Resolved range; condition evaluated later by continue / until
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
